**Review src/Parser with Graham Campbell, Fatima Zahra and Dmitri Volkov.** Graham holds most of the surviving code, so the other two add a second and third view.

Figures are surviving lines in `src/Parser` at HEAD, counted with `git blame -w -M -C`. All 10 files and 961 lines were counted. The counts are not a sample.

